        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Exploring Student Experiences in Virtual Learning Environments: A Qualitative Study</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --bg:#fbfbd4;\n    --teal:#128f74;\n    --blue:#3b82e8;\n    --mint:#a6efc8;\n    --dark:#123f36;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:var(--bg);\n    font-family:\"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color:#1a2b28;\n  }\n  .page{\n    max-width:1660px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    padding:60px 60px 40px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .subtitle{\n    text-align:center;\n    color:var(--blue);\n    font-size:34px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin:40px 0 10px;\n  }\n  h1.maintitle{\n    text-align:center;\n    color:var(--teal);\n    font-size:150px;\n    line-height:0.95;\n    letter-spacing:-2px;\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-family:\"Arial Narrow\", Impact, Haettenschweiler, sans-serif;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    margin:10px 0 25px;\n  }\n  .rule{\n    border:0;\n    border-top:5px solid var(--teal);\n    margin:0 40px 35px;\n  }\n  .authors{\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:26px;\n    margin-bottom:45px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Section headings ---------- */\n  h2{\n    color:var(--teal);\n    font-family:\"Arial Narrow\", Impact, sans-serif;\n    font-weight:900;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    letter-spacing:0.5px;\n    font-size:40px;\n    margin:0 0 22px;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Top three-column zone ---------- */\n  .top-zone{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:stretch;\n    gap:0;\n    margin-bottom:60px;\n  }\n  .col-intro{\n    width:22%;\n    padding-right:35px;\n    border-right:4px solid var(--teal);\n  }\n  .col-figure{\n    width:44%;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    justify-content:center;\n    padding:0 20px;\n  }\n  .col-method{\n    width:34%;\n    padding-left:35px;\n    border-left:4px solid var(--teal);\n  }\n  .col-intro p, .col-method p{\n    font-size:21px;\n    line-height:1.45;\n    margin:0;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder{\n    border:2px dashed var(--teal);\n    color:var(--teal);\n    background:rgba(166,239,200,.25);\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:15px;\n    padding:6px;\n  }\n  .globe-ph{width:500px;height:460px;}\n  /* ---------- Results ---------- */\n  .results{\n    background:var(--mint);\n    padding:45px 60px 60px;\n    margin-bottom:70px;\n  }\n  .results h2{text-align:center;font-size:44px;margin-bottom:25px;}\n  .results-lead{\n    text-align:center;\n    color:var(--blue);\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:22px;\n    margin:0 0 45px;\n  }\n  .stat-row{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n  }\n  .stat-row.first{\n    border-bottom:3px solid var(--teal);\n    padding-bottom:35px;\n    margin-bottom:35px;\n  }\n  .stat-cell{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    gap:18px;\n    width:34%;\n    padding-right:30px;\n  }\n  .stat-cell.mid{\n    border-left:4px solid var(--teal);\n    padding-left:40px;\n  }\n  .chart-cell{\n    width:32%;\n    border-left:4px solid var(--teal);\n    padding-left:40px;\n  }\n  .pct{\n    color:var(--blue);\n    font-size:72px;\n    font-weight:900;\n    font-family:\"Arial Narrow\", Impact, sans-serif;\n    line-height:1;\n  }\n  .stat-text{font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;}\n  .chart-title{\n    color:var(--blue);\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:20px;\n    margin:0 0 18px;\n  }\n  .chart-flex{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:15px;}\n  .legend{font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;}\n  .swatch{\n    display:inline-block;\n    width:16px;height:16px;\n    margin-right:8px;\n    vertical-align:-2px;\n    border:1px solid #128f74;\n  }\n  .sw-teal{background:#128f74;}\n  .sw-blue{background:#3b6fe8;}\n  .sw-white{background:#ffffff;}\n  .icon-ph{width:90px;height:100px;}\n  .gauge-ph{width:250px;height:130px;}\n  /* ---------- Discussion / Conclusion ---------- */\n  .mid-zone{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:stretch;\n    margin-bottom:65px;\n    padding:0 40px;\n  }\n  .col-disc{\n    width:50%;\n    padding-right:45px;\n  }\n  .col-conc{\n    width:50%;\n    padding-left:45px;\n    border-left:4px solid var(--teal);\n  }\n  .col-disc p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;}\n  .col-conc p.lead{font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;margin:0 0 25px;}\n  .col-conc ul{\n    list-style:none;\n    padding-left:20px;\n    margin:0;\n    font-size:21px;\n    line-height:1.7;\n  }\n  .col-conc li::before{content:\"· \";}\n  /* ---------- References ---------- */\n  h2.refs{\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:44px;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .refs-rule{\n    border:0;\n    border-top:5px solid var(--teal);\n    margin:0 0 30px;\n  }\n  .refs-zone{\n    display:flex;\n    gap:80px;\n    font-size:17px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n  }\n  .refs-col{width:50%;}\n  .refs-col ul{\n    list-style:none;\n    margin:0;\n    padding-left:18px;\n  }\n  .refs-col li{\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n    text-indent:-18px;\n    padding-left:18px;\n  }\n  .refs-col li::before{content:\"◦ \";}\n  .note{margin-top:26px;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">Exploring Student Experiences in Virtual Learning Environments:</div>\n  <h1 class=\"maintitle\">A Qualitative Study</h1>\n  <hr class=\"rule\">\n  <div class=\"authors\">John H., Kylie W., Rose S.</div>\n\n  <!-- Top three-column zone -->\n  <div class=\"top-zone\">\n    <div class=\"col-intro\">\n      <h2>Introduction</h2>\n      <p>The shift to virtual learning has transformed education, yet students’ lived experiences remain underexplored. This study investigates how students perceive virtual learning environments (VLEs), focusing on challenges, benefits, and overall engagement. The findings aim to inform improvements in digital education strategies.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-figure\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder globe-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Illustration: globe with media icons (envelope, play button, music notes, photos, profile card, magnifying glass) — centered top]</figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-method\">\n      <h2>Methodology</h2>\n      <p>This study used a qualitative phenomenological approach to examine the experiences of university students in virtual learning. Data were collected through 25 semi-structured interviews and three focus group discussions with students from diverse disciplines and academic levels. Participants were recruited via purposive sampling to ensure representation of varying levels of engagement with VLEs. Thematic analysis was conducted using NVivo software, with triangulation of interviews and focus groups to enhance validity.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Results -->\n  <section class=\"results\">\n    <h2>Results</h2>\n    <p class=\"results-lead\">Quantitative insights were drawn from the thematic analysis to highlight key findings:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"stat-row first\">\n      <div class=\"stat-cell\">\n        <span class=\"pct\">92%</span>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder icon-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Icon: person]</figure>\n        <span class=\"stat-text\">of participants appreciated the flexibility of virtual learning</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stat-cell mid\">\n        <span class=\"pct\">68%</span>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder icon-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Icon: server &amp; monitors]</figure>\n        <span class=\"stat-text\">faced moderate to severe challenges with internet connectivity, particularly in rural areas</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"chart-cell\">\n        <p class=\"chart-title\">Challenges with Internet Connectivity</p>\n        <div class=\"chart-flex\">\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <div><span class=\"swatch sw-teal\"></span>No Issues</div>\n            <div><span class=\"swatch sw-blue\"></span>Moderate</div>\n            <div><span class=\"swatch sw-white\"></span>Severe</div>\n          </div>\n          <figure class=\"placeholder gauge-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Chart: semi-circular gauge, right of legend]</figure>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stat-row\">\n      <div class=\"stat-cell\">\n        <span class=\"pct\">76%</span>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder icon-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Icon: pencil]</figure>\n        <span class=\"stat-text\">of students felt disengaged during online classes due to limited interaction</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stat-cell mid\">\n        <span class=\"pct\">85%</span>\n        <figure class=\"placeholder icon-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Icon: networked computers]</figure>\n        <span class=\"stat-text\">reported increased engagement, when breakout rooms were used effectively</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"chart-cell\">\n        <p class=\"chart-title\">Students Reporting Engagement Improvements with Breakout Rooms</p>\n        <div class=\"chart-flex\">\n          <div class=\"legend\">\n            <div><span class=\"swatch sw-teal\"></span>Engage</div>\n            <div><span class=\"swatch sw-white\"></span>Not Engaged</div>\n          </div>\n          <figure class=\"placeholder gauge-ph\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Chart: semi-circular gauge, right of legend]</figure>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Discussion / Conclusion -->\n  <div class=\"mid-zone\">\n    <div class=\"col-disc\">\n      <h2>Discussion</h2>\n      <p>The study highlights the dual-edged nature of virtual learning: while flexibility enhances accessibility, poor engagement and technical challenges hinder learning outcomes. These findings underscore the need for robust digital infrastructure, consistent use of engagement tools, and personalized support systems.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-conc\">\n      <h2>Conclusion</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">To improve virtual learning, institutions should:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Provide comprehensive training for students and instructors on digital tools.</li>\n        <li>Standardize engagement practices, such as interactive discussions.</li>\n        <li>Enhance technical support services and address digital equity issues.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- References -->\n  <h2 class=\"refs\">References</h2>\n  <hr class=\"refs-rule\">\n  <div class=\"refs-zone\">\n    <div class=\"refs-col\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Smith, J. A., &amp; Lee, K. H. (2021). Student engagement and motivation in virtual classrooms:</strong> A qualitative exploration. Journal of Educational Technology, 45(3), 215-229. https://doi.org/10.1234/jet.2021.0306</li>\n        <li><strong>Brown, R. T., &amp; Miller, S. P. (2020). Navigating the digital divide:</strong> Challenges and opportunities in virtual learning environments. International Journal of Distance Education, 32(2), 98-112. https://doi.org/10.5678/ijde.2020.0205</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"refs-col\">\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Thompson, L. M., &amp; Garcia, M. A. (2022). Perceptions of online learning:</strong> A case study of university students during the COVID-19 pandemic. Educational Psychology Review, 35(4), 341-356. https://doi.org/10.7890/epr.2022.0402</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"note\">[All information here is for demonstration purposes and does not reflect actual data or outcomes.]</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
